Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, well, I'm a little bit worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, is there anywhere\Nto get a cheeseburger there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always heard India was a land\Nof curry, disease, too many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried my stomach won't be\Nable to handle the culture gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That assessment is rather distorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a country of extraordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I assure you, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.61,0:00:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we've reached Calcutta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
