Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want a tattoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.87,0:00:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:00:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need some antivenom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't hurt your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay at our hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.33,0:01:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calcutta, India.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the 20th century, its\Npopulation is 11 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calcutta buzzes with a bustling energy\Nthat will pull you in and never let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need any.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sending some cow shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's already stolen my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tip, tip, tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't give me tips,\Nyou won't go to heaven, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, don't put your\Nnose all over my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.57,0:01:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, so this is India?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great country, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're what makes India\Ngreat, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:02:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.89,0:03:07.93,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,475)\pos(192,815)\fscx(86)}Episode 10: The Emperor and the Hanged Man, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is chai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you'll find it to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chai, one of India's most popular drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sweet concoction made by boiling\Nblack tea, sugar, and ginger with milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, at last a little piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient with India.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you get used to it, you'll\Nsee how wonderful this country is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I kind of like this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.83,0:03:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hell of a lot of\Nculture shock, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll like it once\NI get used to it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess people adapt to\Ntheir surroundings eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the John?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.99,0:03:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right over there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to order first?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It better be something amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:04:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something gorgeous and sophisticated\Nthat suits a Frenchman such as moi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's something he'll like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.49,0:04:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, use this while you're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.23,0:04:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do with this? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the toilet looks weird, but at least\Nit's a lot cleaner than I had expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gentleman like myself\Nhas certain standards
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and won't stand for it\Nwhen a bathroom is dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:04:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The toilet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The toilet!
