Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.55,0:05:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's actually quite friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The builders constructed the pig pen down\Nbelow higher than they were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, when the pigs get hungry,\Nthey come up for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not even what\NI'm asking you about!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me that\Nthis pig's food is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why it's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I told you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, use this stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, now you can do your business\Nwhile the pig's knocked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, some like the pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.11,0:05:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our manager gets the pig to lick his\Nbuttocks and always sings the pig's praises.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gets it so clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, monsieur!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me alone!
