Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.20,0:06:15.24,SFXPurple,3,0,0,0,,{=4}{\bord0\blur0.8\fade(255,0,255,-6960,-6660,39,40)\frz6.584\org(59.88,63.484)\pos(59.88,63.484)\4a&HFF&}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait until we get to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.51,0:06:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I saw someone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, there was a pig in\Nthe john, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a little monster\Nin the mirror anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what they mean\Nby culture shock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only see this damn\Nthing in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be the mirror\Nstand Jotaro talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merde, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mon dieu, this is so not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That new Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did that bastard go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where's the user? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:07:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man with two right hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that was it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that stand belongs\Nto who I think it does,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that means I finally found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, the stand user who\Nuses the mirrors, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard who killed my\Nsister, my angelic sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scum who heartlessly\Ntrampled my sister's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soul and pride. Who destroyed the world's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most pure heart finally finally we meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you absolutely sure\Nit's him it's settled mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, I'll be traveling on\Nmy own from here on out. With
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my sister's murderer finally\Nwithin reach I'll be Damned
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I'm going to wait for him\Nto come after me I'm screwed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he gets that drop on me\Nand that's just not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.51,0:09:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find him first and kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't even know what he\Nlooks like or what his stand is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got two right hands,\Nthat's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, he knows\Nthat I'm coming after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should put him on the\Ndefensive and give me the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.53,0:09:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tough talk for a man who's\Ndigging his own grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as it sounds, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.19,0:09:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you implying that I'm going to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy attacked in\Norder to isolate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's exploiting your biggest weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go alone, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to say it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole time, I never\Nonce gave a damn about Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.41,0:09:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you in Hong Kong that I would go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with you so that\NI could get my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:09:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Jotaro already know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I've been alone from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been fighting alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You selfish fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that you\Nwere brainwashed by Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you so foolish you forgot\Nthat he's the root of all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how it feels to have\Nyour sister murdered, so shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the last time you met Dio,\Nyou pissed yourself and ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A coward like you would never\Nunderstand why I need to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just got lucky the day\Nyou beat me in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with this lecturing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did that offend you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a lot angrier than you are right now\Nand with a hell of a lot better reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can just keep being yourself with\Nyour holier-than-thou attitude, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that his mind is made up, I\Ndoubt that anybody could stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've lost all respect\Nfor him, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My impression of him was completely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are correct in that I\Ndid run in fear from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm certain that\NForesight will let us win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rushing in without thinking\Nwill get us killed. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll say this with certainty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your precious little\Ndivination will be wrong.
