Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to see a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get gone, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please make me your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life will belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just say whatever you wish of me, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me be by your side forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.83,0:12:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still only 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm old enough to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm just a no-good drifter, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.35,0:12:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I live each day like it's my last, and\None day, the end will come for me. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no life for a lady,\Nand you have royal blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't have a fairytale marriage, no\Nmatter how much we might love each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never said that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:12:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love me? Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:13:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only woman I've ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I love you\Nthat we can't marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to be happy\Nand have something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This breaks my heart just\Nas much as it breaks yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll come back to see you and\Nhold you like this whenever I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough to make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, love you, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's bad manners to eavesdrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I spend too much\Ntime on romance, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you've got girls like her all\Nover the world at your beck and call,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, you've always\Ngot an ally, a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are aware of how I work,\Naren't you, Mr. Centerfold?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are aware of how I work,\Naren't you, Mr. Centerfold?
