Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.23,0:14:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about this Silver Chariot's Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems that he left the group and\Nis looking for you on his own.
