Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:16:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he really didn't come back after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you absolutely sure you\Nsaw a man with two right hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was just right there.\NThere! What? There.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was with that man in the street.
