Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gun is mightier than\Nthe sword. Huh? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, if I do say\Nso myself. Wait. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whole whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what they call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a stand user, just like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my card is the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio paid me to get rid of you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so say your prayers and\Nget ready for a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look here, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.87,0:17:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a rat's\Nass who you say you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the man with two right hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was pretty rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked who I am, so I answered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.11,0:17:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nearby. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really no point\Nat all in you asking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Whole Horse, will have the\Npleasure of snuffing you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arrogant morons like\Nyou always talk trash,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it always ends up\Nthe other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, was that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio had you pegged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff has the fatal habit of\Nunderestimating his opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beating him into a corpse\Nwon't be any trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.59,0:18:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was exactly right, so\NI couldn't help but laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't face him until I defeat you,\Nthen that's just what I'll do, chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of military chess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tank is stronger than the soldier,\Nand the tanks are weak against the mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, it's pretty much\Nthe basics of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My emperor is stronger than you,\Nso I thought I'd be a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know my stand's abilities\Nbefore we fight, so we're square.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gun is mightier than the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a brilliant quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I have a stand that shoots, and a\Nsword simply can't beat that. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pea shooter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You underestimated me.
