Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It bypassed my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullet is also my stand, and\Nunderestimating me just cost you your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.99,0:19:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been worried about you,\Nand now look where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ego will end you, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:20:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're worried about me? Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.95,0:20:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came here to lecture me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy already knows\Neverything about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.19,0:20:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you're a loner, but from now\Non, you won't be able to win alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What bad timing for an\Noutsider to interfere.
