Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.31,0:20:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullet's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Matryshids, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll melt it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that, Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.67,0:20:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went after Polnareff himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Mr. Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, I have a terrible feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.23,0:20:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a weird\Nfight going on over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plot hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, today must be my day. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gun and centerfold's mirror don't do\Nvery well against Avdol's flames, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were sure he'd be our\Nmost formidable enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With him gone, the game is in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just hurt, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a minor wound, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.61,0:21:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to start speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll open his eyes in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Mr. Avdol? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:21:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to wake up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, you've got to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.29,0:22:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please! Mr. Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That seemed awfully easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.03,0:22:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was too quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what he gets for lecturing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.13,0:22:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say, Polnareff? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.43,0:22:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.33,0:22:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who asked him for help\Nbecause I never did?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He likes to meddle in\Nother people's business,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.65,0:22:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's slow as hell, so they got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.75,0:22:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys like him just get\Nin the way and screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.49,0:22:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I said I was going in alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.03,0:22:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.69,0:22:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sick of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.03,0:23:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having people up and die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.09,0:23:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.39,0:23:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.03,0:23:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.75,0:23:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.25,0:23:42.62,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.51,0:23:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.62,0:23:44.88,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick, oh-way-oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.88,0:23:46.34,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.13,0:23:49.59,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the bars are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.59,0:23:51.93,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.89,0:23:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got their money on a bet.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.93,0:23:54.26,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.89,0:23:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:54.26,0:23:55.76,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.53,0:23:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:56.43,0:23:58.89,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.49,0:24:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling types of the hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:58.89,0:24:01.10,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:24:08.11,0:24:10.65,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.93,0:24:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.53,0:24:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:22.04,0:24:24.50,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.49,0:24:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:24.50,0:24:26.88,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.49,0:24:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:26.88,0:24:28.13,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.01,0:24:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then\Nthey bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.17,0:24:31.51,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.17,0:24:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:31.51,0:24:33.84,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.79,0:24:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.84,0:24:36.18,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.87,0:24:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:36.18,0:24:37.64,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.25,0:24:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:38.47,0:24:40.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.11,0:24:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:40.81,0:24:43.02,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.95,0:24:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.15,0:24:53.24,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 1,0:24:54.57,0:24:56.57,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode {PREVIEW IS NOT UP TO DATE}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.83,0:24:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For such a tough guy, he\Nsure was easy to finish off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.33,0:25:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, that sweet sister\Nof yours was really good at sobbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.87,0:25:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to hold these\Nregrets inside and run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.37,0:25:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you, you're\Nmuch stronger than that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.99,0:25:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol told you.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:07.58,0:25:09.59,Next Episode,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,105)\fs100}Episode 11
